WEBVTT

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.350
Who the hell are you?

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:52.460
Things are proceeding smoothly, Largo.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:59.880
This is all to secure our passport to
our new world, Anri. However...

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:05.320
...before that, we must destroy them...

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:09.820
...those bitches who confront me at every turn...

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.860
The Knight Sabers!

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:17.680
What... what are you doing?

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:25.800
<i>What the hell happened... to me...?</i>

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.260
<i>What about D.D.?</i>

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.110
<i>What's that?</i>

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:46.300
<i>The Knight Sabers...! Oh, so they... What the?!</i>

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:19.220
Morning, Leon. Oh, why so grumpy?

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.690
Look over here, Leon. We've got a case.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:26.380
Oh, it's you... What's up?

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.990
Genom Industrial Complex No. 3, on the waterfront.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:35.020
Your darlings pulled a hell of a stunt.
Turned the place upside down.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:36.940
Give me the highlights.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.860
We've got a live witness.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:44.110
It looks like it was the genuine
Knight Sabers, after all.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.290
All right, I'll be right there.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:18.100
A container full of Combat Boomers, stolen! What a fiasco!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:24.310
Letting that gang do as they pleased
was the root of our problems!

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:26.950
What the hell kind of instructions is Security giving to...

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:30.030
...the various concerned sections? Well, Bauer?!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:37.020
I must agree! Despite huge contributions,
neither the Police, nor the AD Police...

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.090
...have been of any use!

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:44.400
I think we've had enough personal attacks, don't you?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.130
I want you to think about this dispassionately.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:51.140
It is not inconceivable for those suit
configurations to be an extension...

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:56.440
...of combat suits on which our
company halted development.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:00.980
Someone may well be secretly assisting them.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:04.820
Is this your idea of a joke?!

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:08.590
If anyone knew anything, it would have
been my predecessor, Flint, not me.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:12.690
At any rate, combat suit and cyberdroid development was...

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:16.570
...supposedly halted ages ago!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:28.540
A grave situation, is it not.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:34.510
So, have you ascertained what the Knight Sabers are after?

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:39.750
I am sorry, sir. We are exerting ourselves to the fullest.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.850
However, their intervention in this secret internal project...

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:46.590
...which we are using Callahan to advance,
leads us to believe that someone...

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:52.110
...who has access to classified company
information may be involved.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.780
I see... Is there any proof?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:06:00.210
Uh, no... We think it is a strong possibility...

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:06.410
All right then. Send Madigan to my office.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.380
Cer... Certainly, Sir!

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:26.310
It appears to display a smooth expansion, doesn't it.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:29.640
But we must act cautiously concerning Tanzaar and Zambique.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:31.990
If it became known that we were directly
involved in these coups d'etat...

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:35.530
...protests from other countries would come pouring in.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:40.650
You needn't worry on that score.
We're paying strict attention with regard...

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:43.420
...to establishing accounts. For example, Tanzaar...

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.150
Who's that?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:47.340
The face is unfamiliar. Who is that?

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.490
Oh, that's Milly Jackson.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:54.160
She was transferred here four days ago.
I think she was at GPCC before that.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.090
Is something wrong?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:11.320
Ms. Madigan! The Chairman wants to see you.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:16.650
The Chairman? OK. Inform him that I'm on my way.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:37.970
Still in all, they put on some show, didn't they...

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:42.770
But what do you suppose was in the stolen container?

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.340
I dunno.

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:48.360
The only thing that's certain is that it was nothing good.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.790
They work for money, when all's said and done.

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:59.460
After all, I told you that getting involved
with women would be the death of you.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:00.780
Jerk!

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:07.040
So this next one comes with a warning?
It's bugging the hell out of me!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.820
Well, well!

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:29.420
If it isn't Nene! Listen, when it comes to pistols...

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:42.320
An audacious warning from the
diabolical Knight Sabers:

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:45.700
We will appear at the Tinsel
City Bank in three days!!

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.710
I can't stand it!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:54.390
This makes us look like we're INCREDIBLY evil!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:57.950
We don't just look evil, we are evil,
as far as everyone's concerned.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:02.970
In any case, we can't just sit back
and let them get away with it!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:10.470
Let's do them, Sylia. This "warning" is a blatant challenge to us!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.150
Let's blow them away!

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:18.070
It could be somebody's idea of a joke.
Besides, no one would be so dumb...

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:22.230
...as to use a code that even AD Police could break.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:28.910
The incident has made Genom nervous.
Furthermore, from the evidence...

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:32.520
...we can deduce that someone who knows a lot about us is responsible.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:36.340
Just think about what that means!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:43.170
Aw, Sylia, they're giving us grief!
Let's trash 'em! Right, Priss?

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:46.370
I mean, challenging us is really an obnoxious thing to do!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.780
I'm sorry, but... I quit.

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.670
Right, quit! ...What?!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.400
What... What do you mean, Priss?

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.320
I only came here today to tell you that.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.160
Wait! Priss!

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:11.920
She's still in shock over Sylvie.
I can't blame her.

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:14.190
What'll we do, Sylia?

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:18.100
With Priss, we were at a disadvantage.
Without her, it's not even a fight!

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:24.000
It's not as if we don't have contingency plans.
They'll just take more time.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.260
Well? Have you finished that check?

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:40.880
Yes, ma'am. Of the bearers of new
I.D. cards that the Tower and its...

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:44.070
...principal subsidiaries have issued in the past six months...

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:48.870
...a total of 126 men and women have
been marked for investigation.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:54.500
126, huh? All right. Check, as quickly
as possible, for people in that group...

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:58.570
...who can access top-secret company information.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:10:59.830
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:05.930
Sending me on this rathunt is just the Chairman being capricious.

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:10.550
That's his schedule for the week. Will it do?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.350
Well done, Anri.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:19.560
Once we have Callahan, Genom's bigshot Defense Minister...

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:24.280
...along with the combat Boomers slated for military exportation...

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:29.870
...even Quincy will be forced to give me what I want.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:36.040
Master Largo! We bombarded the data network with the challenge...

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.920
...as you directed, sir.

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:44.510
Make no mistake: finish them off. Do not fail!

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.880
Yes, sir!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:51.240
Now we can finally avenge Sylvie, right?

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.700
That's right, Anri.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:12:00.040
We cannot allow those evil people to get
away with killing your dear Sylvie.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.640
I'm glad.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:07.080
Soon, you'll be truly free. Just a little longer.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:08.700
Largo...

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:29.760
This is Leon. What's it like over there?

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:33.400
This is Point-01. Everything's fine right now... Just a moment!

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:34.270
What is it?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.070
What's that...?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.510
It's the Knight Sabers! They took out our men!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:49.210
I'm going in! Attack Formation SW-01!

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:03.630
Shit, it's all going to hell!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.800
Ready a K-12S! I'm going in too!

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:18.340
Hurry up, Knight Sabers! When you
get here, it will be the end for you!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.940
Are you sure you should throw this away?

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:23.040
It's the poster from your first live concert, isn't it?

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:25.580
Sylia...

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:32.220
There was no answer, so I let myself in.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:33.970
Here.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:42.530
I feel bad... I really do feel bad about it...
but I can't go on like this...

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:46.020
What happened wasn't your fault, Priss...

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:51.070
You're wrong! It was my fault. I let Sylvie die...

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:54.710
...just because I wasn't strong enough!

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.440
Priss...

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.210
It's me.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.210
We got trouble!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.880
The fakers have shown up at Tinsel City
Bank, just as their warning said!

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:10.820
AD Police were waiting. Now they're
engaged in battle! What do we do?

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.990
I see. This one won't be a typical outing, after all.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.640
It won't?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:20.810
I mean, tonight will be special.
Call Linna! Prepare to move out!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:27.340
I have faith in you, Priss.

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:31.150
I'm sorry...

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:49.430
Why? Why? I don't buy it!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:58.770
Knight Sabers... Go!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:01.720
What?!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.790
So you've revealed your true selves...
OK, you two, here we go!

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.370
OK!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:27.130
Ha! The real ones have shown up!

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.610
Leon! Leon!

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:33.940
What is it? You got some nerve!
It's just getting good now!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:38.020
Someone's kidnapped Defense Minister Callahan!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.080
What?!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.990
The kidnappers are escaping via
the freeway! What do we do?

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:47.280
You jerk! The only thing to do is go after them!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.590
It's started! I'll leave this to you, Knight Sabers!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:59.130
<i>Where are they?
They're gone!</i>

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.330
Damn!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:12.460
<i>They're tough!</i>

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.580
Sylia!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:21.970
Stop! You're gonna fight us!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:25.390
OK, then! Come on!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.910
Just who are you, anyway?

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:43.830
You think you're just going to get
away with this sort of thing?

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:50.150
Do be quiet for a while, Mr. Minister.

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.420
Soon, your usefulness will be at an end.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:54.840
Anri! Quickly!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.250
Yes, sir!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:16.470
<i>She was wearing her hair differently,
but that was definitely Anri...</i>

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:22.580
<i>What's she still doing in town? And who was that man with her?</i>

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:26.410
I've finished that data check, Ms. Madigan.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.420
All right, put it onscreen.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:29.330
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:43.170
<i>Milly Jackson... It is her, after all... but why...?</i>

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.400
Ms. Madigan!

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:49.470
There's a message from Boomer Omega-4,
in pursuit of the kidnappers.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.850
Take them out, car and all! It doesn't matter!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.770
But the Minister!

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:59.420
It doesn't matter! He's just a puppet!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.860
If we don't seal his lips, there'll be hell to pay!

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:05.060
They're slowing down!
It's now or never!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.230
Strike!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.160
Commencing attack!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:11.080
Here he comes!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.370
It's a Genom operative.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:17.380
It seems that Milly Jackson will also
be done away with today, Anri.

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.500
How did they find out about me?

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:23.510
They probably put Bauer under the Deep Psychology Scanner.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.020
All right, pull over.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:33.620
We'll catch up to them in three minutes.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:37.760
What! Three minutes? Do it in one!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:38.980
That's crazy!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.740
What's that?

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.250
What is it? Is something happening?

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.880
A woman!

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.390
We're getting visual.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:15.990
I am Largo, the person who has Minister Callahan.
I'll be with you shortly.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:19.700
I'm of a mind to meet directly with the Chairman.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:24.000
So that's how it is. You're really sure of yourself.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.150
So what do you want in exchange for the Minister?

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:30.640
Tell him "OMS," would you?

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:36.820
The OverMind Control System...?
How in the world?!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:41.720
Oh, so you know what it is? You seem like a sharp one, indeed.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.810
Well, we'll meet soon.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.010
No... Wait!

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:48.370
The signal has stopped.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:59.520
AD Police! You'll come quietly if you
don't want to be blown away.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.280
Hey, good going, Leon!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:12.450
All right, open both hands, and lie facedown!

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.950
What do you think you're doing? Do as I say!

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:44.440
As high-spirited as ever, aren't you, Leon McNichol?

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:49.460
You know... who I am?

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:54.830
Uh-huh, because my associates love you to death, you see.

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.110
Die!

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.690
Anri!

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:27.330
Why, that's...

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:30.860
Wait! Largo!

00:22:34.470 --> 00:22:35.740
Anri...

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:38.930
Priss!

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:09.360
I've taken care of the interlopers.
Let's go, Anri.

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:10.230
Uh, yes, sir.

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:17.750
Priss...

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:40.500
Aw, shit! Leon, you OK?

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:46.540
Priss... What are you doing here?

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:50.220
Just passing by... Who was that guy, anyway?

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:53.640
I dunno... It all happened so fast...

00:23:53.720 --> 00:24:00.280
Son of a bitch! A monster should at
least look like a monster... Ow...

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:06.230
<i>Could it have been a satellite attack? But how...?</i>

00:24:07.270 --> 00:24:08.290
Priss...

00:24:11.870 --> 00:24:16.630
It's pretty dangerous this time.
This isn't like your previous enemies.

00:24:16.980 --> 00:24:18.700
What... what are you talking about?

00:24:18.820 --> 00:24:20.050
Just listen to me!

00:24:21.350 --> 00:24:25.980
Don't stick your neck out any further.
Leave this to AD Police.

00:24:27.090 --> 00:24:30.780
I don't want you... getting hurt.

00:24:43.670 --> 00:24:47.620
Looks like your friends are here.
Have them pick you up off the ground.

00:24:48.110 --> 00:24:51.790
Priss! Will you be all right, in the shape you're in?

00:24:52.250 --> 00:24:55.210
No way am I getting into bed with
you, not even a hospital bed!

00:25:16.270 --> 00:25:20.230
What! It's out of the question.

00:25:20.310 --> 00:25:26.080
Giving him the OMS would result in him
replacing Genom as ruler of the world!

00:25:26.350 --> 00:25:32.480
But if word gets out from the Minister of
our violations of international law...

00:25:32.550 --> 00:25:34.180
...there'll be protests from all over the world!

00:25:34.320 --> 00:25:39.690
Protests we can deal with, but they can only occur if...

00:25:39.760 --> 00:25:41.490
...the human species survives intact.

00:25:41.560 --> 00:25:44.430
Now, he's coming here?

00:25:44.830 --> 00:25:47.390
Yes, Sir. He was bold enough to contact us.

00:25:47.530 --> 00:25:52.600
All right. Send him to me without delay. I'll see him.

00:25:53.810 --> 00:25:56.240
But, Sir, then you'll be...

00:25:56.380 --> 00:25:59.070
I want to see, with my own eyes, the guy...

00:26:00.510 --> 00:26:04.510
...who's capable of engineering something like this.

00:26:17.300 --> 00:26:20.790
What are we gonna do, Sylia?
There's nowhere left to run to!

00:26:24.370 --> 00:26:29.930
Linna, Nene, I'll draw their attention!
When I do, you two beat it!

00:26:30.080 --> 00:26:32.060
Sylia! No!

00:26:32.610 --> 00:26:35.730
That's an order! OK?

00:26:35.950 --> 00:26:37.210
Sylia...

00:26:38.020 --> 00:26:39.880
This is the finale!

00:26:40.620 --> 00:26:41.610
Now!

00:26:45.620 --> 00:26:47.560
Everyone! Duck!

00:26:52.670 --> 00:26:53.910
Climb on, quick!

00:27:04.710 --> 00:27:08.410
Saved. That was a close one.

00:27:08.550 --> 00:27:09.740
We got trouble!

00:27:09.820 --> 00:27:13.270
Priss's suit and motoroid are missing from the equipment bay!

00:27:13.420 --> 00:27:17.690
What?! She's going in alone?! I don't believe it!

00:27:17.690 --> 00:27:21.110
What? You let them slip through your fingers?

00:27:21.890 --> 00:27:26.420
We're terribly sorry. There was some incredible interference...

00:27:26.570 --> 00:27:32.330
Well, fine. All of you, head over here too.
I'm putting on a big show.

00:27:32.470 --> 00:27:33.500
Yes, sir.

00:27:35.440 --> 00:27:37.970
We will arrive at the front entrance shortly.

00:28:03.200 --> 00:28:08.780
I'm... I'm terribly sorry. It was truly careless of me.

00:28:08.940 --> 00:28:13.220
But don't worry, Ma'am! I revealed
nothing about military secrets...

00:28:15.650 --> 00:28:20.850
Well, well. To sacrifice even a Minister...

00:28:20.920 --> 00:28:23.010
That's the Genom way, all right.

00:28:23.460 --> 00:28:26.540
The Chairman awaits. This way.

00:28:32.600 --> 00:28:34.360
Beautiful.

00:28:34.900 --> 00:28:39.840
Having once experienced these heights,
one may not be able to go back...

00:28:39.910 --> 00:28:42.600
...not even if one is a sage.

00:28:44.260 --> 00:28:45.530
It's lovely.

00:28:45.610 --> 00:28:48.940
The light is swallowing everything up.

00:28:50.450 --> 00:28:54.250
Soon all of this light will be ours.

00:28:54.250 --> 00:28:55.920
Optimistic, aren't you.

00:28:56.890 --> 00:29:01.190
Burn this view into your eyes. You may not get to see it again.

00:29:08.930 --> 00:29:11.660
Rather an impressive-looking sort, aren't you.

00:29:12.970 --> 00:29:19.900
I've heard your demand from Madigan, here.
Mind if I ask you something?

00:29:20.710 --> 00:29:23.820
Why do you want this thing?

00:29:24.850 --> 00:29:28.220
Cyberdroids are creatures which mankind created...

00:29:28.290 --> 00:29:31.870
...ones with the potential to be a new species.

00:29:31.990 --> 00:29:36.450
You people treat them like nothing more than merchandise.

00:29:36.530 --> 00:29:39.690
It is only right for me to have the OMS.

00:29:39.770 --> 00:29:45.210
It burdens corrupt, ignoble Genom...
and especially you, Old Man.

00:29:45.740 --> 00:29:48.520
Watch your mouth! We won't stand for that!

00:29:48.520 --> 00:29:49.630
Hold it.

00:29:49.940 --> 00:29:54.140
I tell you what, Largo, you said your
name was? Come work for me.

00:29:54.210 --> 00:30:00.350
You've said enough about what you want to do.
I want a man of your talents.

00:30:00.420 --> 00:30:01.940
Or else...

00:30:12.430 --> 00:30:14.960
It seems you've slipped your moorings, Largo.

00:30:15.100 --> 00:30:17.860
Let me show you something interesting.

00:30:18.970 --> 00:30:23.000
Put the Genom Towers around
the world on the Multivision.

00:30:23.310 --> 00:30:25.320
What are you leading up to now?

00:30:25.320 --> 00:30:25.920
Hold it!

00:30:27.580 --> 00:30:30.110
Do as he says.

00:30:35.550 --> 00:30:37.990
And now, on with the show...

00:30:38.060 --> 00:30:44.190
For starters, the tower currently under
construction, in Sydney, Australia!

00:30:56.380 --> 00:31:03.470
Next, Illinois, the USA. Then Berlin, West Germany.

00:31:08.250 --> 00:31:10.850
What... what have you done?

00:31:12.830 --> 00:31:15.260
My will.

00:31:16.500 --> 00:31:20.900
You mean, you have a direct link with
the orbital particle-beam satellites?

00:31:21.030 --> 00:31:22.160
Precisely!

00:31:22.570 --> 00:31:29.070
If I so desire, my children will destroy
every Genom Tower on Earth!

00:31:29.140 --> 00:31:33.670
I can't believe this. USSD was supposed to have...

00:31:33.670 --> 00:31:36.610
...stopped developing the Killer Dolls after that incident!

00:31:36.750 --> 00:31:39.550
So you still find it difficult to believe.

00:31:40.050 --> 00:31:42.290
In that case, observe with your own eyes!

00:31:55.700 --> 00:31:58.330
Are you a SuperBoomer?!

00:31:58.470 --> 00:32:01.810
I'd prefer we stop using such crude language.

00:32:02.270 --> 00:32:06.980
My name is Largo. I am the maker of the new world.

00:32:07.280 --> 00:32:09.900
Now, hand it over to me!

00:32:10.320 --> 00:32:13.790
You rotten son of a bitch... Kill him!

00:32:26.770 --> 00:32:31.090
Anri, I will rescue you...

00:32:31.200 --> 00:32:35.670
...for both Sylvie's and your sakes!
Here I come!

00:32:52.890 --> 00:32:58.260
No! Cyberdroids cannot possibly coexist with humans!

00:32:58.330 --> 00:33:00.530
If we released them, they would
become insanely destructive...

00:33:00.600 --> 00:33:03.090
...and a powerful enemy of mankind.

00:33:03.240 --> 00:33:05.170
They are waiting...

00:33:05.240 --> 00:33:08.710
...the multitudes of my people, whose
hearts and souls you have bound.

00:33:09.310 --> 00:33:12.070
I shall lead them.

00:33:12.210 --> 00:33:15.380
You bastard! Do you mean to become a god?

00:33:15.710 --> 00:33:19.210
I don't know. That depends on human beings...

00:33:23.420 --> 00:33:24.890
You tricked me, Quincy!

00:33:30.830 --> 00:33:33.260
A double? It can't be...

00:33:33.770 --> 00:33:38.650
As far as I knew, the real Quincy had to be here!

00:33:38.960 --> 00:33:41.820
Oh, no... Sir...

00:33:48.050 --> 00:33:52.640
Well done... well done, Largo,
or whatever your name is.

00:33:54.190 --> 00:34:00.920
Alas, it was all for naught. It'll be a long
time before anyone gets the OMS.

00:34:01.120 --> 00:34:02.890
Especially you, you bastard!

00:34:06.700 --> 00:34:09.430
There's no point in us staying any longer. Let's go, Anri.

00:34:10.100 --> 00:34:13.980
Anri, I've come for you.
Come with me!

00:34:14.310 --> 00:34:15.850
That voice...

00:34:16.580 --> 00:34:21.570
Allow me to explain, Anri.
This is the bitch who killed Sylvie!

00:34:21.710 --> 00:34:23.910
I don't know what lies you've
been filling her head with...

00:34:23.910 --> 00:34:28.340
...but I won't let you drag her any deeper into this!

00:34:28.490 --> 00:34:33.830
Is that you, Priss? I can't believe that
you're one of the Knight Sabers...

00:34:34.160 --> 00:34:36.810
...that you killed Sylvie!

00:34:40.630 --> 00:34:44.740
Anri, let me now show you the true face...

00:34:44.740 --> 00:34:47.430
...of the perpetrator who trampled
your dreams under her feet.

00:34:56.350 --> 00:34:59.550
Priss... It can't be...

00:35:05.550 --> 00:35:10.490
Now is the time. She's upset. She, who killed your dear Sylvie...

00:35:10.560 --> 00:35:14.790
...is your hated foe.
Kill her. Kill her!

00:35:26.580 --> 00:35:32.480
Sylvie... I've finally been able to avenge you...

00:35:37.720 --> 00:35:40.590
Priss, why...?

00:35:40.730 --> 00:35:47.060
Sylvie was beyond help. If I hadn't done what I did...

00:35:47.130 --> 00:35:52.260
...the D.D. would have exploded,
wiping out the entire city...

00:35:52.340 --> 00:35:59.440
I'm sorry, I'm so sorry... There was nothing I could do...

00:36:02.710 --> 00:36:05.740
I couldn't protect her...

00:36:06.920 --> 00:36:10.820
Oh, no! Priss!

00:36:14.730 --> 00:36:17.220
Looking to apologize, Priss?

00:36:17.300 --> 00:36:22.110
It amazes me that you were actually
able to shoot that 33-S, Sylvie.

00:36:22.200 --> 00:36:26.780
Had it continued on, out of control,
it would have been amusing.

00:36:30.480 --> 00:36:34.740
Still, after D.D.'s existence became public knowledge...

00:36:34.810 --> 00:36:41.280
...that eyesore Flint fell from grace.
GPCC became completely mine...

00:36:41.350 --> 00:36:44.300
...and thus I accelerated development of the HyperBoomers.

00:36:45.260 --> 00:36:47.450
So Sylvie was...?

00:36:47.590 --> 00:36:50.720
A cat's-paw of mine, I suppose you might say.

00:36:50.760 --> 00:36:56.140
But it was just one Sexaroid. Nothing of consequence.

00:36:56.840 --> 00:37:01.670
Hmh? Why are you looking at me like
that? Oh, is this hurting you?

00:37:01.740 --> 00:37:06.110
Well, it's not as if you can do anything about it now.

00:37:06.180 --> 00:37:09.990
All right, step aside, Anri! You too
have now served your purpose.

00:37:10.250 --> 00:37:13.080
Playtime is over.

00:37:19.990 --> 00:37:22.280
Anri...!

00:37:26.230 --> 00:37:28.290
Anri... Why...?

00:37:28.430 --> 00:37:33.100
Largo and I wanted to make a world for our kind...

00:37:33.170 --> 00:37:39.700
...but I didn't want to destroy
the city, or kill people either.

00:37:39.780 --> 00:37:42.920
Sylvie felt the same, I'm sure...

00:37:42.920 --> 00:37:45.360
Don't talk, Anri.

00:37:46.180 --> 00:37:57.080
Priss, I beg you... live... Live...
for me... and for Sylvie...

00:37:58.400 --> 00:38:03.930
Priss... thank you...

00:38:04.420 --> 00:38:13.340
You little idiot! If you die, what
will Sylvie have died for?

00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:15.090
Dead, eh?

00:38:16.620 --> 00:38:21.770
Or rather, I imagine it would be more exact
to say that it has ceased functioning.

00:38:22.020 --> 00:38:24.420
It IS a machine, after all!

00:38:25.570 --> 00:38:27.220
You bastard!

00:38:32.230 --> 00:38:35.910
Is this all your anger amounts to?

00:38:49.110 --> 00:38:53.180
How stupid of you to think you were a match for me!

00:38:53.650 --> 00:38:57.590
You've come all this way, only to die like a dog!

00:39:00.290 --> 00:39:05.700
I won't be beaten... I can't be
beaten... not in THIS fight!

00:39:09.330 --> 00:39:14.830
Allow me to pay homage to your admirable, albeit trifling, bravery, Priss.

00:39:14.910 --> 00:39:16.270
Take a good look!

00:39:24.180 --> 00:39:31.030
THIS is the look of the true victor!
Now I will kill you with a thought!

00:39:31.720 --> 00:39:34.720
You can't be... !

00:40:04.160 --> 00:40:09.250
It seems I won't need to dirty my hands, after all. Kill her!

00:40:31.420 --> 00:40:33.710
This is humiliating! Shit!

00:40:33.790 --> 00:40:36.990
Is this it? Is this the end?!

00:40:37.920 --> 00:40:41.980
You will carry this humiliation to your grave, worm!

00:40:48.400 --> 00:40:54.130
I want power... power enough to lay this bastard low...

00:40:55.970 --> 00:40:58.270
Greater, stronger power!

00:41:07.590 --> 00:41:08.550
Go!

00:41:21.730 --> 00:41:23.460
Oh no you don't!

00:41:35.080 --> 00:41:36.550
It can't be!

00:41:38.920 --> 00:41:43.480
Here I come, you monstrous bastard!

00:41:46.220 --> 00:41:47.280
You're in my way!

00:42:06.410 --> 00:42:10.080
What incredible destructive power...
If he'd actually connected...

00:42:12.020 --> 00:42:14.850
So the worm is a worm after all.

00:42:14.920 --> 00:42:18.460
With my next attack, I'll send you to Hell!

00:42:19.160 --> 00:42:22.390
I won't run... I won't run away again!

00:42:22.460 --> 00:42:25.330
Anri... Sylvie...

00:42:25.400 --> 00:42:29.420
Give... me... STRENGTH!

00:42:30.200 --> 00:42:31.100
DIE!

00:42:51.660 --> 00:42:54.320
I... I did it...!

00:42:57.330 --> 00:42:58.420
Sylia...

00:42:58.500 --> 00:43:01.390
Well done, Priss. Looks like we made it just in time.

00:43:01.640 --> 00:43:03.930
Priss!

00:43:05.850 --> 00:43:06.720
All of you...

00:43:06.850 --> 00:43:12.270
Human beings... how vulgar!

00:43:12.980 --> 00:43:19.280
For the crime of injuring me, a god...

00:43:19.920 --> 00:43:24.360
...I demand, as atonement, death.

00:43:24.800 --> 00:43:26.030
Oh, no! Linna!

00:43:32.960 --> 00:43:34.790
Nene, support me!

00:43:34.790 --> 00:43:36.100
OK!

00:43:40.340 --> 00:43:42.800
Error correction: left 0.06 degrees.

00:43:43.080 --> 00:43:43.970
DIE!

00:43:45.180 --> 00:43:48.670
FIRE!

00:44:10.640 --> 00:44:14.800
<i>Sylia... Sylia Stingray...</i>

00:44:15.470 --> 00:44:19.050
<i>How do you know my name?</i>

00:44:20.710 --> 00:44:30.390
<i>I know... that you and I are two of a kind... because...</i>

00:44:30.520 --> 00:44:31.850
Sylia! Look out!

00:44:53.910 --> 00:44:55.420
Leon...

00:45:08.550 --> 00:45:10.130
Daybreak.

00:45:23.840 --> 00:45:26.300
Leon's quite a guy, he is.

00:45:26.630 --> 00:45:30.490
We did it! But... do you suppose he's dead?

00:45:31.280 --> 00:45:37.220
He's got to be. Nobody could survive a fall from this height.

00:45:37.360 --> 00:45:40.100
<i>Anri... Sylvie...</i>

00:45:51.230 --> 00:45:57.030
<i>Frail humans need not fear anything more...</i>

00:45:57.110 --> 00:45:59.370
<i>...Brian J. Mason.</i>

00:46:15.990 --> 00:46:27.740
<b><i>"Let's dance!" Why not seriously let</i>
<i>out the emotions that you embrace?</i></b>

00:46:27.810 --> 00:46:40.150
<b><i>"Let's dance!" No one can stop the rock</i>-
<i>show whose curtain is going up.</i></b>

00:46:40.220 --> 00:46:45.950
<b><i>"You're a lonely boy, but you don't know I'm a lonely girl."</i></b>

00:46:46.020 --> 00:46:55.330
<b><i>With a downcast face, you can't see the</i>
<i>freeway that follows the stars, at all.</i></b>

00:46:55.400 --> 00:47:01.340
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" Rock my heart!</i></b>

00:47:01.410 --> 00:47:07.310
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" Hold me tight!</i></b>

00:47:07.410 --> 00:47:15.840
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" In the way that only you can!</i></b>

00:47:30.500 --> 00:47:42.310
<b><i>"Let's dance!" I want to feel a</i>
<i>hot session with you tonight.</i></b>

00:47:42.380 --> 00:47:54.620
<b><i>"Let's dance!" No one can stop</i>
<i>this rockshow if we fall in love.</i></b>

00:47:54.690 --> 00:48:00.530
<b><i>"I can feel you. But you can't feel me, touch me?"</i></b>

00:48:00.600 --> 00:48:09.970
<b><i>I'm really a lonely person, but I do believe in happiness.</i></b>

00:48:10.040 --> 00:48:15.810
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" Hit me with your heart!</i></b>

00:48:15.880 --> 00:48:21.750
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" There's nothing to lose!</i></b>

00:48:21.820 --> 00:48:30.990
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" In the only way we can live now!</i></b>

00:48:31.060 --> 00:48:36.560
<b><i>Someday you ought to understand...</i></b>

00:48:36.630 --> 00:48:46.070
<b><i>...the loneliness of not having someone to love.</i></b>

00:48:57.920 --> 00:49:03.790
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" Rock my heart!</i></b>

00:49:03.860 --> 00:49:09.700
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" Hold me tight!</i></b>

00:49:09.770 --> 00:49:14.800
<b><i>"Rock me! Just you!" Only you can do it!</i></b>

00:49:14.870 --> 00:49:18.040
<b><i>"Rock me, rock me..."</i></b>

00:49:18.110 --> 00:49:22.770
<b><i>Tonight... ROCKME!</i></b>
